    {
      "id": "claim_5e1cf92ca3ee45588efc1bad0ba16657",
      "statement": "HO-3, HO-4, and HO-6 each provide a Coverage E structure for covered damages arising from bodily injury or property damage caused by an occurrence and an insurer-paid defense, but their defense wording, exclusions, additional coverages, and conditions differ, so one form's result cannot be generalized to another.",
