      "statement": "Coverage F medical payments is a separate coverage analysis from Coverage E: the reviewed forms describe necessary medical expenses caused by an accident without making payment dependent on legal liability, while eligibility, limits, exclusions, time periods, and duties vary by form.",
      "evidence": [
        {
