    {
      "id": "claim_35d17e31307748758933b2b58b5fbc87",
      "statement": "When allegations potentially fall within the liability grant and no exclusion clearly eliminates a defense obligation, counsel may be appointed through approved procedures; counsel receives the pleadings, service details, coverage correspondence, known facts, evidence, deadlines, and instructions, while defense activity and spending are monitored.",
      "evidence": [
        {
