      "id": "claim_f59678225183427f9970298a0c661ba6",
      "statement": "Before settlement or payment, the handler must review allegations, damages, coverage allocation, release terms, payees, other insurance, and recovery effects; a complete release is required unless counsel approves another resolution, and revised material terms require renewed authority.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://guidelines/claims/liability-claim-handling.md#L579-L587",
