    {
      "id": "claim_13ac7925706a4791935bc91c60889336",
      "statement": "The HO-3, HO-4, and HO-6 liability conditions restrict an insured from voluntarily paying, assuming an obligation, or incurring expense without the insurer's consent and require cooperation and prompt forwarding of claim or suit papers, subject to each form's precise exceptions and surrounding terms.",
