      "statement": "A liability claim may be closed only after material defense, indemnity, expense, payment, recovery, reporting, communication, and dispute obligations are resolved or transferred; the file must retain the coverage analysis, approvals, evidence, litigation and payment records, release or alternative resolution, chronology, and closure rationale, and credible new material information requires reopening review.",
